OL,3,AThree ways the interest rate rise could
OL,4,Aaffect you
OL,5,
OL,6,FInterest rates have been raised for the
OL,7,Ffirst time in more than three years -
OL,8,Fand it could be good and bad news for
OL,9,Fyou.
OL,11,FHere are three ways the increase to 4%
OL,12,Ffrom 3.75% could affect you.
OL,14,FRate-setters at the Bank make changes
OL,15,Fto interest rates to fulfil their role
OL,16,Fof keeping price rises at a steady
OL,17,Flevel.
OL,19,FHigher rates are meant to encourage
OL,20,Fpeople to spend less, reducing demand
OL,21,Ffor goods and services and limiting
OL,22,Fprice rises.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
